calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025, July to August came in at 54% of normal and November to December at 44%. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 43% and February to March at 41% on the middle of the grids. On grid 16360, the preliminary August to September 2026 estimate is 32.8, and the driest year there was 1965 at 64%.</p>"}
